<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Nov 5.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Nov 5.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day (upto 0635 GMT) and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at 0635 GMT was 3086.71, 6.01 points or 0.19 percent lower than Monday's close.</p>
